    "description": {
      "value": "Wind flows from your outstretched hands and whirls around you in a 5-foot emanation. Each creature in the area takes 1d6 bludgeoning damage, with a Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is pushed 5 feet away from you.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d6."
    },
